  "description": "An AOT-clean, OpenAI-compatible IChatClient (Microsoft.Extensions.AI) for WebReaper, built on raw HttpClient and System.Text.Json source generation with no provider SDK. Point it at OpenAI, Ollama, OpenRouter, vLLM, or any OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint and pass it to WithLlmExtractor / WithLlmSchemaInferrer. JSON-mode chat completions for schema-free --prompt and inferred-schema --infer extraction (ADR-0084). The AOT-safe bring-your-own chat client the ecosystem lacks.",
